config FLPR_SPWM_BLE
	bool "Advertise over BLE while the FLPR streams"
	depends on BT
	help
	  Non-connectable advertising at a 20 ms interval, to load the app core
	  and RAM while the bench cases run (B5, O3). overlay-ble.conf sets it.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
